 },
 {
  "en": "Right.",
  "start": 2242.41,
  "end": 2244.17
 },
 {
  "en": "And then he's gonna ask you: \"Did you give support and comfort to Michael Scofield and Lincoln Burrows...",
  "start": 2244.34,
  "end": 2249.54
 },
 {
  "en": "... since the escape? \" You'll say yes.",
  "start": 2249.71,
  "end": 2252.77
 },
 {
  "en": "And then the sentence will be immediately handed down.",
  "start": 2252.95,
  "end": 2255.65
 },
 {
  "en": "The prosecution is asking that you do your time...",
  "start": 2256.02,
  "end": 2258.49
 },
 {
  "en": "... in a maximum security facility.",
  "start": 2258.66,
  "end": 2260.95
 },
 {
  "en": "I think the judge is going to agree to that.",
  "start": 2263.16,
  "end": 2266.53
 },
 {
  "en": "Okay.",
  "start": 2268.63,
  "end": 2270.26
 },
 {
  "en": "With good behavior...",
  "start": 2273.04,
  "end": 2274.97
 },
 {
  "en": "... how many years of my sentence can I expect to serve?",
  "start": 2275.14,
  "end": 2277.94
 },
 {
  "en": "On a 1 2-year sentence...",
  "start": 2278.31,
  "end": 2280.8
 },
 {
  "en": "... you'll do nine years.",
  "start": 2281.81,
  "end": 2284.25
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll be out before I'm 40.",
  "start": 2287.28,
  "end": 2289.28
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry, Sara.",
  "start": 2289.62,
  "end": 2290.85
 },
 {
  "en": "Sara, are you ready for this?",
  "start": 2293.19,
  "end": 2295.95
 },
 {
  "en": "What?",
  "start": 2297.73,
  "end": 2298.96
 },
 {
  "en": "A very credible witness has just come forward...",
  "start": 2299.13,
  "end": 2301.46
 },
 {
  "en": "... and he's willing to testify.",
  "start": 2301.63,
  "end": 2303.0
 },
 {
  "en": "He'll corroborate everything you've said about this conspiracy.",
  "start": 2303.17,
  "end": 2305.97
 },
 {
  "en": "Who?",
  "start": 2306.14,
  "end": 2307.57
 },
 {
  "en": "Linc?",
  "start": 2364.33,
  "end": 2365.82
 },
 {
  "en": "Linc?",
  "start": 2379.98,
  "end": 2381.74
 },
 {
  "en": "Do you speak English?",
  "start": 2395.36,
  "end": 2397.69
 },
 {
  "en": "Si, señor. Yes, I do.",
  "start": 2395.36,
  "end": 2397.69
 },
 {
  "en": "Good, good. I need to get in contact with every hospital in the Panama City area.",
  "start": 2397.86,
  "end": 2402.93
 },
 {
  "en": "A friend of mine was....",
  "start": 2403.1,
  "end": 2405.36
 },
 {
  "en": "A friend of mine was in a car accident.",
  "start": 2405.54,
  "end": 2407.63
 },
 {
  "en": "Sir?",
  "start": 2408.57,
  "end": 2410.27
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry, I'm gonna have to call you back.",
  "start": 2410.44,
  "end": 2412.53
 },
 {
  "en": "Linc?",
  "start": 2413.08,
  "end": 2414.44
 },
 {
  "en": "I'm sorry, Michael.",
  "start": 2415.18,
  "end": 2417.77
 },
 {
  "en": "What's wrong?",
  "start": 2415.18,
  "end": 2417.77
 },
 {
  "en": "Hello, Michael.",
  "start": 2422.69,
  "end": 2424.09
 },
 {
  "en": "If you touch my brother, you're a dead man.",
  "start": 2425.46,
  "end": 2427.58
 },
 {
  "en": "Oh, please.",
  "start": 2427.76,
  "end": 2429.16
 },
 {
  "en": "You don't have to worry about that.",
  "start": 2429.33,
  "end": 2431.42
 },
 {
  "en": "But when it comes right down to it...",
  "start": 2433.7,
  "end": 2435.96
 },
 {
  "en": "... he's just like you.",
  "start": 2437.27,
  "end": 2439.39
 },
 {
  "en": "He has a heart that won't kill a man.",
  "start": 2440.07,
  "end": 2442.83
 },
 {
  "en": "Give me the handcuffs, or I swear to God, I'll blow your head clean off.",
  "start": 2444.88,
  "end": 2450.14
 },
 {
  "en": "What do you want, Alex?",
  "start": 2474.24,
  "end": 2475.8
 },
 {
  "en": "I'll tell you exactly what I want. But first things first.",
  "start": 2475.97,
  "end": 2479.97
 },
 {
  "en": "When the authorities captured Bagwell today...",
  "start": 2480.14,
  "end": 2483.2
 },
 {
  "en": "... the money was nowhere to be found.",
  "start": 2483.71,
  "end": 2487.38
 },
 {
  "en": "Now, I can only assume...",
  "start": 2488.22,
  "end": 2490.98
 },
 {
  "en": "... that you've got the money...",
  "start": 2491.39,
  "end": 2493.51
 },
 {
  "en": "... aboard the Christina Rose right now.",
  "start": 2494.96,
  "end": 2498.22
 },
 {
  "en": "It's an amazing plan. Take the money, take the boat and disappear forever.",
  "start": 2498.39,
  "end": 2501.73
 },
 {
  "en": "But you are not the only one that needs to disappear.",
  "start": 2503.53,
  "end": 2508.84
 },
 {
  "en": "Are you still there?",
  "start": 2509.01,
  "end": 2511.94
 },
 {
  "en": "Yeah, I'm still here.",
  "start": 2509.01,
  "end": 2511.94
 },
 {
  "en": "Good. Because I'm gonna say this and I'm gonna say this once: Bring me the money, bring me the boat.",
  "start": 2512.11,
  "end": 2518.41
 },
 {
  "en": "You are out of your mind.",
  "start": 2520.28,
  "end": 2521.88
 },
 {
  "en": "Not really.",
  "start": 2522.05,
  "end": 2523.45
 },
 {
  "en": "We both have something the other person needs.",
  "start": 2523.62,
  "end": 2525.82
 },
 {
  "en": "It all comes down to this, Michael: Your brother for your plan.",
  "start": 2526.66,
  "end": 2532.06
 },
 {
  "en": "Five minutes. That's what you have.",
  "start": 2533.43,
  "end": 2536.42
 }
]